  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You receive a sorted array of distinct integers and a target value, output the index if the target is found. If not, output the index where it would be if it were inserted in order.\n\nYou must write an algorithm with `O(log n)` runtime complexity.",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
